<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Rendez-vous de suivi créé</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { background: #e6f0fa !important; } }
    body { margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#e6f0fa; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
    .container { max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; padding:24px 16px; }
    .card { background:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #c5dff8; overflow:hidden; }
    .header { background:#7ec8e3; padding:24px 32px; }
    .header h1 { margin:0; color:#ffffff; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; }
    .body { padding:32px; }
    .body p { margin:0 0 16px; line-height:1.6; color:#2c3e4f; font-size:15px; }
    .body .highlight { font-size:16px; color:#1e2b3c; }
    .body .info-table { background:#e6f0fa; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid #c5dff8; padding:16px; margin:16px 0; width:100%; }
    .body .info-table td { padding:4px 0; font-size:14px; color:#0f1a2b; }
    .body .info-table .label { color:#3a5a7a; font-size:13px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px; }
    .body .info-table .value { font-weight:500; }
    .body .btn { display:inline-block; background:#7ec8e3; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; padding:12px 32px; border-radius:50px; font-weight:bold; font-size:15px; }
    .footer { padding:16px 32px; background:#f2f6fa; border-top:1px solid #dce5ef; text-align:center; font-size:11px; color:#7a9ab5; line-height:1.5; }
    .footer .copy { margin:6px 0 0; color:#9ab0c8; }
    .body .subnote { font-size:13px; color:#5a7a9a; margin:16px 0 0; }
    @media (max-width:600px) {
      .header, .body, .footer { padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; }
      .btn { display:block; text-align:center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#e6f0fa; padding:24px 16px;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #c5dff8; overflow:hidden;">
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#7ec8e3; padding:24px 32px;">
              <span style="color:#ffffff; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold;">Rendez-vous de suivi</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:32px;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:16px; color:#1e2b3c;">Bonjour {{studentName}},</p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15px; color:#2c3e4f; line-height:1.6;">
                Un rendez-vous de suivi a été planifié dans le cadre de votre procédure.
              </p>

              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#e6f0fa; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid #c5dff8; padding:16px; margin:16px 0;">
                <tr><td style="padding:4px 0; font-size:13px; color:#3a5a7a; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Procédure</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:0 0 12px; font-size:15px; color:#0f1a2b; font-weight:500;">#{{procedureId}}</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:4px 0; font-size:13px; color:#3a5a7a; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Consultant</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:0 0 12px; font-size:15px; color:#0f1a2b; font-weight:500;">{{consultant}}</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:4px 0; font-size:13px; color:#3a5a7a; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Date</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:0 0 12px; font-size:15px; color:#0f1a2b; font-weight:500;">{{date}}</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:4px 0; font-size:13px; color:#3a5a7a; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Heure</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:0 0 12px; font-size:15px; color:#0f1a2b; font-weight:500;">{{heure}}</td></tr>
                {{#if raison}}
                  <tr><td style="padding:4px 0; font-size:13px; color:#3a5a7a; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Motif</td></tr>
                  <tr><td style="padding:0; font-size:15px; color:#0f1a2b; font-weight:500;">{{raison}}</td></tr>
                {{/if}}
              </table>

              <p style="margin:16px 0 24px; font-size:15px; color:#2c3e4f; line-height:1.6;">
                Ce rendez-vous vous permettra de faire le point sur l'avancement de votre dossier.
              </p>

              {{#if FRONTEND_URL}}
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 16px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center">
                      <a href="{{FRONTEND_URL}}" style="display:inline-block; background:#7ec8e3; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; padding:12px 32px; border-radius:50px; font-weight:bold; font-size:15px;">Voir ma procédure</a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              {{/if}}

              <p style="font-size:13px; color:#5a7a9a; margin:16px 0 0;">
                Vous pouvez modifier ou annuler ce rendez-vous depuis votre espace étudiant.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:16px 32px; background:#f2f6fa; border-top:1px solid #dce5ef; text-align:center; font-size:11px; color:#7a9ab5; line-height:1.5;">
              <p style="margin:0;">Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement, merci de ne pas y répondre.</p>
              <p style="margin:6px 0 0; color:#9ab0c8;">&copy; {{year}} Paname Consulting</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>